-- DATA MIGRATION: Sync Head Office Payment Follow-Up from uploaded Excel
-- Run this in your EXISTING Supabase project's SQL Editor.
--
-- Replaces ALL existing Head Office Payment Follow-Up records with the
-- 183 records from the uploaded 'Copy_of_Payment_Follow_Up_Head_office.xlsx'
-- file, so the database exactly matches the Excel (same to same).
--
-- \xE2\x9A\xA0\xEF\xB8\x8F This DELETES every existing Head Office record first, then inserts
-- fresh ones from the Excel. If you've entered/edited anything in the
-- app for Head Office since this Excel was last exported, THAT DATA
-- WILL BE LOST. Only run this if the Excel is the source of truth.
--
-- Safe to re-run (each run replaces Head Office data with this same set).
-- =====================================================================

